def gcd(a, b):
    for d in range(min(a, b), 0, -1):
        if a % d == 0 and b % d == 0:
            return d
    return 1

This tries every divisor from min(a,b) down to 1. Time complexity: O(min(a,b)) which is equivalent to O(log n) because we stop early once we find the GCD.

